      {
        "name": "places/ChIJm9hzyLYABDQRNzE5JDFV8zY/reviews/Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT21GZmIydGxaRnBIY1Y5S1NreGtaV3BIU0VWdU0yYxAB",
        "relativePublishTimeDescription": "3 個月前",
        "rating": 1,
        "text": {
          "text": "吃咗六隻生蠔一個鐘之後以經feel 到唔舒服\n\n第二日痛到今日5:00起身、一日之內屙咗九次、全身發冷、隻腳好軟、頭痛。\n\n食咩藥都冇用，最尾淩最12. 去睇急症😁\n\n*上個月去韓國食醬油蟹，喺澳洲三日內食咗18隻生蠔我都冇事，所以絕對唔係因為我腸胃弱😁應該係佢啲生蠔處理不當\n\n總結：唔建議喺呢度食生蠔，得不償失😁😁😁\n\nI ate six raw oysters, and started feeling unwell an hour later.\n\nI was in pain so badly that I got up at 5 a.m. the next day. I had diarrhoea nine times in one day, felt chills all over, weak legs and a headache.\n\nNo medicine helped at all, so I ended up going to the emergency department at midnight 😁\n\nLast month I had marinated soy‑sauce crab in Korea, and ate 18 raw oysters within three days in Australia without any issues. So it’s definitely not that I have a weak stomach 😁 It must be that their oysters were poorly handled when arrived in HK\n\nConclusion: I don’t recommend eating raw oysters here — it’s not worth it 😁😁😁",
          "languageCode": "zh-Hant"
        },
        "originalText": {
          "text": "吃咗六隻生蠔一個鐘之後以經feel 到唔舒服\n\n第二日痛到今日5:00起身、一日之內屙咗九次、全身發冷、隻腳好軟、頭痛。\n\n食咩藥都冇用，最尾淩最12. 去睇急症😁\n\n*上個月去韓國食醬油蟹，喺澳洲三日內食咗18隻生蠔我都冇事，所以絕對唔係因為我腸胃弱😁應該係佢啲生蠔處理不當\n\n總結：唔建議喺呢度食生蠔，得不償失😁😁😁\n\nI ate six raw oysters, and started feeling unwell an hour later.\n\nI was in pain so badly that I got up at 5 a.m. the next day. I had diarrhoea nine times in one day, felt chills all over, weak legs and a headache.\n\nNo medicine helped at all, so I ended up going to the emergency department at midnight 😁\n\nLast month I had marinated soy‑sauce crab in Korea, and ate 18 raw oysters within three days in Australia without any issues. So it’s definitely not that I have a weak stomach 😁 It must be that their oysters were poorly handled when arrived in HK\n\nConclusion: I don’t recommend eating raw oysters here — it’s not worth it 😁😁😁",
          "languageCode": "zh-Hant"
        },
